# BBE theory writing

When writing or rewriting Full Course theory markdown, follow **`scripts/bbe-theory-writing-memory.md`** as the single source of truth for structure, voice, examples, and scope.

Hard rules:

- One shared format across chapters so students are not confused.
- Only topics that exist on the live chapter map; do not invent extra sections.
- Gold-standard tone/structure: `src/data/math-theory/ch13.md`.
- Human tutor voice; few em-dashes; no AI filler.
- Register new math chapters in `src/data/math-course-theory.ts`.
